1
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,440
The brushes, ink, paper, and inkstones
the Eldest Lady uses daily

2
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,760
are all gone.

3
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,600
Why do you arbitrarily withhold them?

4
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,460
It's not like we're starving her.

5
00:00:57,760 --> 00:00:58,720
Why are you

6
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:00,010
yelling so loud?

7
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:03,560
That mother and daughter

8
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:04,959
are simply going too far.

9
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:05,840
Xiaolan,

10
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:06,960
let it go.

11
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,880
Not only did they take your painting,

12
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:13,810
but now they won't even
let you use paper and brushes.

13
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:15,600
This painting of the Phoenix Nirvana

14
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:17,130
is made of a special canvas.

15
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:18,680
Even with brushes, ink,
paper, and inkstones,

16
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:20,740
it would probably be hard to restore.

17
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:22,880
Good job.

18
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:27,320
Wan,

19
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:29,900
it has been a while.
I hope you have been well.

20
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:32,320
Young Master Chu,

21
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:33,560
what brings you here?

22
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,160
I

23
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:36,380
came to give you these writing

24
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:37,600
materials.

25
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,200
I have heard this painting

26
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,860
is very important to you, Wan.

27
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,880
If it is damaged and needs restoration,

28
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:49,610
I am willing to help take a look.

29
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,130
How did you know about this?

30
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:56,320
Lady Keying absolutely did not

31
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:57,160
send me here.

32
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,360
Young Master Chu,

33
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:02,360
you are just like when we were kids.

34
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:03,760
You still cannot lie.

35
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:05,720
Xue Keying,

36
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:06,410
come out.

37
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:18,380
What are you scheming now?

38
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:20,480
How could I be scheming anything?

39
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:21,640
I have heard that

40
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:23,400
you and Young Master Chu
are childhood friends.

41
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,120
He is handsome and skilled at painting.

42
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,280
I just wanted

43
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,520
to create an opportunity for you two

44
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,240
to catch up.

45
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:31,090
Xiaolan, return the things to her.

46
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,200
Let's go.

47
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,320
When courting a girl,

48
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,960
you must be indirect,

49
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:49,920
subtle,

50
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,600
and play hard to get.

51
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,320
Why are you so straightforward?

52
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:55,320
Lady Keying, please don't say that.

53
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,360
I, Chu,

54
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,280
have always behaved properly.

55
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,040
I have never had

56
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:01,370
any improper thoughts about your sister.

57
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:02,880
Why are you claiming the friend zone card

58
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:03,640
yourself?

59
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:05,730
Are you the male lead or not?

60
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,340
I did go against you

61
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,440
in every way before,

62
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:16,880
but I'm not

63
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:18,079
who I used to be.

64
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:20,520
Let's get along peacefully from now on.

65
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:21,920
Who would believe that?

66
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:23,380
How can you not believe me?

67
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:24,920
I'm really here to help you.

68
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,280
Ning Yuanci is a total scumbag.

69
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,340
He only married you

70
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:28,520
to control the Xue family

71
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,720
through the alliance.

72
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,480
Of course I know

73
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:31,520
he's no good.

74
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,400
You're so devoted to him,

75
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:36,000
but has he ever changed a bit for you?

76
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,680
You see it quite clearly, don't you?

77
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,320
Then why don't you

78
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,320
reject him

79
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:41,140
and find your official match?

80
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:44,380
What is an official match?

81
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:46,480
Someone who truly loves you.

82
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,980
Someone who cares for you,

83
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,079
understands you,

84
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:50,060
loves you back,

85
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,000
and is willing to spend

86
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,130
their life with you.

87
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:52,800
Like

88
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,420
Chu Qingyun, for example.

89
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,600
I indeed don't like Ning Yuanci,

90
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:01,040
nor do I want to marry him.

91
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,600
But that doesn't mean

92
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:04,080
I have to like another man.

93
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,660
Mutual understanding

94
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,600
and love

95
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,210
are nothing but illusions.

96
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:10,380
Instead of relying on others,

97
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:12,060
it's better to rely on myself.

98
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:13,720
You don't need to worry
about my affairs anymore,

99
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:15,320
sister.

100
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:18,200
What a strong female lead speech.

101
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:19,600
She delivers her lines
even smoother than I do.

102
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,130
Let's go.

103
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:31,680
This woman...

104
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,400
How can I make her

105
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:34,640
listen to me?

106
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,820
What's your relationship

107
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:40,200
with Chu Qingjun?

108
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,159
What does my relationship with him

109
00:04:42,159 --> 00:04:43,220
have to do with you?

110
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,370
If you don't tell me,

111
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,040
he won't live to see

112
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,040
tomorrow.

113
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:51,680
Are you my dad?

114
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:53,120
Why are you so controlling?

115
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,450
That's inappropriate.

116
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,680
So much for your

117
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,000
so-called sincerity.

118
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:00,360
You heard I'm marrying Xue Ruowan,

119
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,960
so you immediately turn around
and flirt with another man,

120
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:03,080
huh?

121
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,680
What did you expect?

122
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,760
Not all women

123
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:07,560
will wait around for you

124
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,520
forever.

125
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,280
Just because I don't like you,

126
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:11,280
doesn't mean I'll immediately

127
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:12,680
find another man.

128
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:13,480
Whatever I said

129
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,440
or did to you

130
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,080
before,

131
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,640
it was all an illusion.

132
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:18,200
Rather than pinning my hopes
on a man like you,

133
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:19,530
I'd be better off alone.

134
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:36,480
My Lady,

135
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,570
are you sure you want to do this?

136
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:40,960
As things stand,

137
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:42,600
there is no other way.

138
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:45,200
I am just worried it is too dangerous.

139
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,860
If I flee the marriage,

140
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,920
it will implicate the entire Xue family.

141
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,720
If I die,

142
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,120
perhaps

143
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,480
Ning Yuanci will

144
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:56,210
spare my father and the others.

145
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,280
Sister is in poor health,

146
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:05,080
and should stay in her room more.

147
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,370
But you, as her maid,

148
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:08,220
always take her out for walks.

149
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:10,280
Always with this attitude.

150
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:11,210
What did you say?

151
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,560
I will slap your face!

152
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,520
Xiaolan,

153
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:15,280
my daily medicine

154
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,560
hasn't been brewed yet.

155
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,600
Go check on it quickly.

156
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,480
We cannot delay.

157
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,480
Yes, My Lady.

158
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:22,760
Xiaolan

159
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:23,920
has been with me since childhood

160
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:25,050
and is deeply loyal.

161
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:28,130
Sister, please do not make
things difficult for her.

162
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:32,360
These servants are failing
in their duties.

163
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,040
Let me

164
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,700
take good care of you, sister.

165
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:38,880
No need.

166
00:06:39,159 --> 00:06:40,490
How could I trouble you?

167
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:42,300
I'm afraid I don't deserve it.

168
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,560
Oh, you deserve it.

169
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:46,290
Let me massage your legs

170
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:47,520
and see if they

171
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,220
really have no feeling at all.

172
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,440
It's just playing the villainess.

173
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:52,440
How hard can it be?

174
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,960
I can act

175
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:55,490
better than Xue Keying 1.0.

176
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,360
Enough.

177
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,440
Just hit me

178
00:06:58,640 --> 00:06:59,520
or scold me

179
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:00,680
as you usually do.

180
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,720
Watching you act like this

181
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,680
is exhausting.

182
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,280
If there's nothing else,

183
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:06,560
I'll go back to rest.

184
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:10,280
Is it because my performance

185
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,200
lacks depth?

186
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:12,560
Watch out, Second Lady!

187
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,560
The bamboo scaffold is collapsing!

188
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,740
What are you doing?

189
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,290
Second Lady,

190
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:21,160
are you alright?

191
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,000
Who told you to put it here?

192
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,000
Put it over there.

193
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:23,960
I deserve to die.

194
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:25,760
I'll have it removed right away.

195
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,080
Are you okay?

196
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:34,440
Why are you looking at me like that?

197
00:07:34,440 --> 00:07:35,840
I'm the one who saved you.

198
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,320
After dealing with the assassins,

199
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:46,400
I still have to prevent Xue Ruowan
from falling into the lake.

200
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:49,560
I really am the busiest second
female lead in this whole drama.

201
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,240
Tonight,

202
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:52,360
I'm going to guard the lake myself.

203
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,890
Let's see who dares to come.

204
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,610
I surrender. Don't kill me.

205
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:06,040
Even Cui Hu couldn't beat the thugs.

206
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:08,160
I shouldn't even try.

207
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:08,960
It's you.

208
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:14,320
Why are you always following me?

209
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:14,880
Didn't I tell you

210
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:16,080
to stay away from me?

211
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,560
Didn't I tell you

212
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:20,200
that I married your sister

213
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:21,600
to comply with His Majesty's will?

214
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,860
I don't like her at all.

215
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:24,080
You are different

216
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,890
from her in my heart.

217
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,320
Stop right there.

218
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:29,250
I really can't stand hearing this.

219
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,280
Not this again.

220
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,740
Can't you come up with something new?

221
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,760
I have real business to attend to.

222
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:38,640
Serving you

223
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:40,280
is not part of my business.

224
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:41,299
From now on,

225
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:42,320
you

226
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:43,700
keep your distance

227
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:45,360
from me.

228
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:51,920
In the past,

229
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:54,640
you were always the one
getting close to me.

230
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:55,800
Now

231
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,380
you are so cold.

232
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:59,360
Do you have a new sweetheart?

233
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:08,460
What does it matter
if I have a sweetheart or not?

234
00:09:13,160 --> 00:09:15,520
Playing the gentle and affectionate role,

235
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:16,920
aren't you just trying to trick me

236
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:18,160
and use me as a tool?

237
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:21,920
The sound of falling into the water.

238
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,920
No way.

239
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,080
Oh no!

240
00:09:25,560 --> 00:09:26,640
Somebody come!

241
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,760
My Lady has fallen into the lake!

242
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:29,640
Somebody!

243
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,200
Help!

244
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:30,960
What happened? What happened?

245
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,400
My Lady fell into the lake!

246
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:33,120
Xue Ruowan!

247
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,360
Somebody come quickly!

248
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,880
My Lady fell into the lake!

249
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:40,120
Help!

250
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:41,080
Quick,

251
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,770
grab the branch!

252
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,000
Somebody come!

253
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:47,360
Help! My Lady fell into the lake!

254
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:47,890
Xiaolan!

255
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:49,160
Don't just stand there.

256
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:49,760
Save her!

257
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:51,800
I-I can't swim.

258
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:53,960
Somebody come!

259
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:54,800
Call for help!

260
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,160
My Lady fell into the water!

261
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,280
Somebody come!

262
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,080
Forget it.

263
00:09:58,400 --> 00:09:59,400
Save her!

264
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,400
I'll do it myself.

265
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:02,240
My Lady fell into the water!

266
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:21,370
This way.

267
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:22,360
Come.

268
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,760
Slow down. Slow down.

269
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:24,280
Hold on.

270
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:25,080
Quick.

271
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:27,720
Hold on tight.
